<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Repco 6-mth net at 2.56 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Repco 6-mth net at 2.56 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)		   2.56   vs    (0.38)</p>
<p>    Earnings/(loss) a shr (cents)  18.0    vs    (2.6)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    145.31   vs     6.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit/(loss)	     5.85   vs    (0.36)</p>
<p>    Minorities		     less 1.32   vs	-</p>
<p>    Dividend				 -     vs	-</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Repco Holdings Bhd is in gaming and timber businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
